{"title":"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/c/32ce5f2fb02c2a4002601cb7682497c2bff7a7c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{sum}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"35\" height=\"11\" /> of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> terms of the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34ca0ab73bca16dff454e0d2459085d6673e72ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 14, 15, 30, 31, 62, 63,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"263\" height=\"16\" /> that appeared\non the First Round? Recall that a term in an even numbered position is twice the previous term, while a\nterm in an odd numbered position is one more that the previous term.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Group every even term with the term following it, like so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bcede49da41ffa501f6822e70699b3343be8c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)+(2+3)+(6+7)+(14+15)+...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"307\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since every odd term is 1 less than a power of two, we know each group will be of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/1/e710fd34e9612be162f8fb68f6004f4cdb87e86b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{n}-2)+(2^{n}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />, or just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06a7aee558ea5f69346fd2547559d35ed3392227.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{n+1}-3$\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />. So our sum becomes\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/751f6e827cc1894682a1ccbbc4bb6517c9f42ed1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{2}-3)+(2^{3}-3)+(2^{4}-3)+...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"266\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Counting yields 500 such groups, leaving us with a geometric series minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42e3d0498ca2dfef33508fd28f146cbeea9b05e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3*500=1500$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />, giving us\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/1/a811ceb55b266e30cce481dbffc52840a123bace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4*(1-2^{500})}{1-2}-1500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"166\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/4/384ba9aa5fe83a263a79a30b80dedcf4f816443b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4*(2^{500}-1)-1500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/4086d098528e232ceb1c05221e097f7311184e19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{2^{502}-1504}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II\">2011 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2011 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017225230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2080/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.279      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    8.279      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13584:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017225230 and revision id 156204. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}